OL,3,GNEWSABoxing stalwart wins Make a
OL,4,ADifference award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boxing coach has been recognised for
OL,7,Fher dedication to promoting the sport
OL,8,Fin Guernsey.
OL,10,FMandy Hobart has been named as the
OL,11,Fwinner of the 2026 BBC Radio Guernsey
OL,12,FMake a Difference Awards.
OL,14,FShe dedicates hours each week to
OL,15,Ftraining youngsters at the Amalgamated
OL,16,FBoxing Club, after-school clubs as well
OL,17,Fas special classes for over-65s and
OL,18,Fpeople with Parkinson's disease.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
