OL,3,GNEWSABoxing stalwart wins Make a
OL,4,ADifference award
OL,5,
OL,6,FHobart, who was surprised with the news
OL,7,Fof her win via a video call, said:
OL,8,F"It's amazing and it's great for the
OL,9,Fclub to be out there [and] for
OL,10,Feverybody to see the good that we're
OL,11,Fdoing."
